# Deep but finite recursion through nested blocks stays within the limit.
to down n
    if n is greater than 0
        while true
            repeat 1 times
                count from 1 to 1 as i
                    smaller is n minus 1
                    result is down smaller
                    return result plus 1
                .
            .
        .
    .
    return 0
.
say down 240
